{"html":"<span id=\"val\" class=\"article-title-anchor\"></span>\n<p>由Lombok提供，类似于c++中的auto关键字，自动推断字段类型，不过只能在局部变量使用<br>\n示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>java</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> java.util.ArrayList;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> java.util.HashMap;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> lombok.val;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ValExample</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-type\">String</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">example</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">()</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-type\">val</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">example</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ArrayList</span>&lt;String&gt;();\n    example.add(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Hello, World!&quot;</span>);\n    <span class=\"hljs-type\">val</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">foo</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> example.get(<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>);\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> foo.toLowerCase();\n  }\n  \n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-type\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">example2</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">()</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-type\">val</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">map</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">HashMap</span>&lt;Integer, String&gt;();\n    map.put(<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;zero&quot;</span>);\n    map.put(<span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;five&quot;</span>);\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (val entry : map.entrySet()) {\n      System.out.printf(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;%d: %s\\n&quot;</span>, entry.getKey(), entry.getValue());\n    }\n  }\n}\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>注意：由于val在Lombok中是一个实际的类，所以要导入才可使用。<br>\n使用了val的局部变量，会自动推导实际类型，并添加final修饰<br>\n对于引用类型，val会推断出父类作为数据类型<br>\n为<code>null</code>时，推断Object</p>\n<h2 id=\"var\">@var</h2>\n<p>是 Lombok 提供的注解，用于自动推断局部变量的类型<br>\n@var于@val类似，但是不添加final修饰</p>\n","toc":[{"level":2,"text":"@var","id":"var"}]}